# --- Stray PGlite scratch dirs (Phase 0) ---
# The bare `pgdata/` rule above does NOT match these: pgdata.bak/ is a manual
# backup and pgtest-onedrive/ is a 27MB OneDrive-lock experiment. Both are
# regenerable local scratch and must never enter git history.
pgdata*/
pgtest*/
packages/db/pgdata*/
packages/db/pgtest*/
